D\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1600</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1600</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1600</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>400</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>N</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Notice that we take the positive square root because <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"16\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D441 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> can't be negative.</p>\n</div></div>",
